This directory contains the build variant for the Remess distribution of this
fork.

It deliberately uses its own appId, product name and URL schemes so that a
Remess install lives alongside an official Element Desktop install rather than
upgrading over the top of it: different Application User Model ID (taskbar and
notification identity), different Squirrel/MSI package identity, different
user data directory (`%APPDATA%/Remess` rather than `%APPDATA%/Element`) and
different deep-link schemes. Nothing here changes the Matrix protocol or the
call stack, so Remess and Element users remain fully interoperable.

Build with:

    VARIANT_PATH=remess/release/build.json pnpm exec electron-builder

and copy `remess/release/config.json` into `webapp/` before packing
`webapp.asar`, the same way `scripts/fetch-package.ts --cfgdir` does for the
element.io variants.
